519
00:26:53,446 --> 00:26:54,522
Goodbye.

520
00:27:12,764 --> 00:27:14,776
I've already talked
to Mr. Matlock.

521
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:17,178
Oh, I know, but now we
have some more questions.

522
00:27:17,202 --> 00:27:18,212
For instance,

523
00:27:18,236 --> 00:27:20,081
now that Robert Ullman is dead,

524
00:27:20,105 --> 00:27:21,750
I guess you don't have
