536
00:27:46,431 --> 00:27:47,509
That's okay.

537
00:27:47,533 --> 00:27:50,111
Ken Pritchard, Michelle, uh,

538
00:27:50,135 --> 00:27:51,746
Thomas, wasn't it?

539
00:27:51,770 --> 00:27:53,414
Yes. We've already met. Yeah.

540
00:27:53,438 --> 00:27:54,883
I was just passing by,

541
00:27:54,907 --> 00:27:58,475
thought I would drop off a
cassette of your new show.

542
00:28:01,146 --> 00:28:02,490
Nice to see you
again, Miss Thomas.

543
00:28:02,514 --> 00:28:04,147
Nice to see you too.

544
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,831
Now, about that vicious rumor.

545
00:28:09,855 --> 00:28:12,334
At last count,
there were 347 suits

546
00:28:12,358 --> 00:28:15,537
