Barnes and Robert Ullman.

548
00:28:21,099 --> 00:28:23,612
Only R. Ullman was contractually

549
00:28:23,636 --> 00:28:26,181
indemnified from
any liability actions,

550
00:28:26,205 --> 00:28:29,016
