563
00:29:16,155 --> 00:29:17,265
You saw.

564
00:29:17,289 --> 00:29:19,067
Dropping off a
tape of Jane's show.

565
00:29:19,091 --> 00:29:20,769
This one?

566
00:29:20,793 --> 00:29:22,470
I don't know.

567
00:29:22,494 --> 00:29:24,338
It is the one.

568
00:29:24,362 --> 00:29:27,542
You know it's blank.

569
00:29:27,566 --> 00:29:28,743
Mr. Pritchard,

570
00:29:28,767 --> 00:29:30,845
