579
00:29:58,664 --> 00:30:01,443
You know who
killed Robert Ullman.

580
00:30:01,467 --> 00:30:04,980
Somebody paid you a lot of money

581
00:30:05,004 --> 00:30:08,538
because you know
who killed Robert Ullman.

582
00:30:12,411 --> 00:30:13,421
Talk to me.

583
00:30:13,445 --> 00:30:14,922
If you won't talk to me here,

584
00:30:14,946 --> 00:30:17,347
I'll make you talk
to me in court.

585
00:30:27,993 --> 00:30:30,772
<i>A killer's fate
is in your hands.</i>

586
00:30:30,796 --> 00:30:34,008
<i>Now, you decide who
killed Robert Ullman.</i>

587
00:30:34,032 --> 00:30:35,577
<i>Call in now.</i>

588
00:30:35,601 --> 00:30:38,046
<i>If you think Jane Barnes
killed Robert Ullman,</i>

