00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:40,114
<i>call this number.</i>

590
00:30:40,138 --> 00:30:42,650
<i>If you think Don Ridgely
killed Robert Ullman,</i>

591
00:30:42,674 --> 00:30:44,218
<i>call this number.</i>

592
00:30:44,242 --> 00:30:45,987
<i>And if you think Stephen Spector</i>

593
00:30:46,011 --> 00:30:49,223
<i>killed Robert Ullman,
call this number.</i>

594
00:30:49,247 --> 00:30:50,625
<i>Your vote will help decide</i>

595
00:30:50,649 --> 00:30:52,293
<i>how this episode should end.</i>

596
00:30:52,317 --> 00:30:53,761
<i>Jot down these numbers.</i>

597
00:30:53,785 --> 00:30:55,096
<i>The lines are open now.</i>

598
00:30:55,120 --> 00:30:57,398
<i>All calls received during
the next seven minutes</i>

599
00:30:57,422 --> 00:30:58,600
<i>will be counted.</i>

600
00:30:58,624 --> 00:31:01,235
<i>You decide who
killed Robert Ullman.</i>

