cream on his own face.

732
00:38:04,982 --> 00:38:07,227
Okay.

733
00:38:07,251 --> 00:38:08,496
Okey-dokey.

734
00:38:09,521 --> 00:38:13,701
Okay, there you go.

735
00:38:14,992 --> 00:38:16,526
Go ahead.

736
00:38:18,996 --> 00:38:20,007
It's okay.

737
00:38:20,031 --> 00:38:21,409
Go ahead.

738
00:38:21,433 --> 00:38:22,510
Put the cream on

739
00:38:22,534 --> 00:38:25,646
so we can reenact
those last moments.

740
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:26,914
Objection, Your Honor.

741
00:38:26,938 --> 00:38:29,417
Is Mr. Matlock serious?

742
00:38:29,441 --> 00:38:32,820
It is hard to see the point
of all this, Mr. Matlock.

743
00:38:32,844 --> 00:38:34,455
It'll become clear in a
moment, Your Honor,

744
00:38:34,479 --> 00:38:37,224
as soon as the witness
puts on the face cream.

745
00:38:37,248 --> 00:38:38,225
Can we go ahead?

746
00:38:38,249 --> 00:38:40,695
Very well. Proceed.

747
00:38:40,719 --> 00:38:43,731
The witness is instructed
to do as he is asked.

748
00:38:43,755 --> 00:38:45,433
I'm not going to put that on.

749
00:38:45,457 --> 00:38:47,435
Why not? Because
I don't want to.

750
00:38:47,459 --> 00:38:50,805
It's because you know
there's a rapidly absorbent,

751
00:38:50,829 --> 00:38:53,908
immediately fatal poison
in that cream, don't you?

752
00:38:53,932 --> 00:38:55,176
I don't know.

753
00:38:55,200 --> 00:39:00,515
And you knew just before
Mr. Ullman started his show

754
00:39:00,539 --> 00:39:03,151
the poisoned cream

755
00:39:03,175 --> 00:39:05,853
was substituted for
the regular cream.

756
00:39:05,877 --> 00:39:06,921
No, I did not.

757
00:39:06,945 --> 00:39:10,524
And so that's how you know

758
00:39:10,548 --> 00:39:12,093
he was murdered. No.

759
00:39:12,117 --> 00:39:13,695
You went to the
killer to blackmail him.

760
00:39:13,719 --> 00:39:14,696
Absolutely not.

761
00:39:14,720 --> 00:39:15,829
And that's what you were doing

762
00:39:15,853 --> 00:39:17,899
with that case full
